<https://ekgf.org/ontology/specification-by-example#>
    rdfs:comment "A vocabulary for executable story scenarios, including initial graph and dataset states, story requests, expected results, chained scenarios, and captured run-time values."@en ;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> .

