<https://ekgf.org/ontology/specification-by-example#Scenario>
    rdfs:comment "An executable example specifying the request, initial state, and expected state or results for a story. Scenarios can be chained through follows."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/specification-by-example#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/specification-by-example#State>
    rdfs:comment "A set of graph and dataset conditions used to describe an initial or expected situation in a scenario."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/specification-by-example#> .

